  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="195a4dbe-c416-5a9d-b0fa-b18326f128a2" activityNameId="3623c4bb-15ce-54ed-a493-571e054cd15a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Silicon, electronic grade, off-grade, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Silicon, electronic grade, off-grade, at plant
The multi-output-process "MG-silicon, to purification" delivers the co-products "silicon, electronic grade", "silicon, electronic grade, off-grade", "silicon tetrachloride". The allocation is based on mass balance and economic criteria. World production of EG-Si was 18'000t in 2000, 2'000t were sold as off-grade Si to the photovoltaic industry. Wacker produced 3'000t EG-Si. Total production SiCl4 1.6 million tonnes from different processes.;
CAS number: 7440-21-3; 
Formula: Si; 
UUID: 333932b3-0be4-39ca-b865-343f5a494ddd
Purification of MG-silicon including materials, energy use, wastes and air emissions.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Production of HSiCl3 with HCl, cleaning, vacuum distillation and production of the three products.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: World production of EG-Si was 18'000t in 2005.
Sampling: Literature data. 
Extrapolations: Some data are derived from other or unknown plants. Extrapolation of European LCI inventory data by changing the consumed electricity mix to the Chinese electricity mix.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_333932b3-0be4-39ca-b865-343f5a494ddd.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="3142d8e2-0d30-557e-b090-9faae2b72357" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
